  "description": "The high-level post-quantum secure channel library for .NET. Three messages to a live session, mutually authenticated, forward-secret, replay-resistant, transport-agnostic. Built on X-Wing hybrid key agreement (ML-KEM-768 + X25519) and ML-DSA-65 signatures, with AES-256-GCM record encryption. Secure-by-default — algorithms and parameters are fixed; there are no insecure knobs. Includes a Stream adapter, DoS-resistant replay protection, NIST SP 800-38D safety bounds, and built-in observability (EventSource + Meter + ActivitySource). Use this instead of wiring primitives together by hand. Targets net8.0 / net9.0 / net10.0.",
  "id": "PostQuantum.SecureChannel",
