  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0-preview.1: Ecosystem-foundation release (wire-compatible with 0.2.x). Adds OpenTelemetry-friendly distributed tracing via System.Diagnostics.ActivitySource alongside the existing Meter/EventSource. Releases two companion packages: PostQuantum.SecureChannel.AspNetCore (DI registration, IConfiguration binding, WebSocket-to-Stream adapter, MapPqWebSocket endpoint helper) and PostQuantum.SecureChannel.Testing (in-memory duplex transport, one-call handshake harness). Adds production-shaped samples (MicroserviceWebSocket, WorkerControlPlane, QueueEnvelope) and architecture/threat-model/decision/operations/troubleshooting docs. Includes 0.2.1-preview.1 hardening: DoS-safe bitmap replay window, NIST SP 800-38D record + byte caps with PqEpochExhaustedException, IDisposable handshakes, AllowedServerIdentities for staged rotation, and named PqSessionOptions presets.",
